# Notebook pages

msgid "左侧上下两口各收一幅纹样，织成一幅左右并排的并纹，少了任何一股，机器都不会开工。"
msgstr "The two ports on the left each take one pattern and weave them side by side into a Joined Pattern. If either strand is missing, the machine will not run."

msgid "收一幅并纹，上口吐出它的左半，下口吐出它的右半，想用哪股接哪股。"
msgstr "Takes a Joined Pattern. The upper port yields its left half and the lower port yields its right half. Connect whichever strand you need."

msgid "左上口自己钉一副纹样，机器会凭空吐出它，但吐出的只是虚纹，切不可放入最终交付，必须用它织出另一幅纹样（也可以与自身相同），接入右上口，随后右下口便可吐出一副实在的叠层纹。"
msgstr "Pin a pattern at the upper-left port. The machine produces it from nothing, but only as a provisional pattern that must never be submitted. Use it to weave another pattern, which may be identical, and feed that into the upper-right port. The lower-right port will then yield a certified Layered Pattern."

msgid "左上口收一副迭层纹，左下口收它上层的纹样，机器吐出下层的纹样。"
msgstr "The upper-left port takes a Layered Pattern, and the lower-left port takes its upper layer. The machine yields the lower layer."

msgid "收一幅纹样，织成岔纹；上口输出的纹样中它在左上，下口输出的纹样中它在右下，对角线另一侧的纹样则由你自己钉。"
msgstr "Takes one pattern and weaves a Forked Pattern. In the upper output it occupies the upper-left branch; in the lower output it occupies the lower-right branch. You pin the pattern on the other side of the diagonal."

msgid "上1口收入一副岔纹，岔纹对角线两侧的纹样分别由右2和右3口吐出，吐出的两幅纹样均为虚纹，若用他们都能织出同一副纹样分别送入左2和左3口，则汇路机可以织出这副纹样的实纹。"
msgstr "Left port 1 takes a Forked Pattern. Right ports 2 and 3 yield the patterns from its two diagonal branches, both as provisional patterns. If each can be used to weave the same result and those results are fed into left ports 2 and 3, the Convergence Machine yields that result as a certified pattern."

msgid "收进一幅焦纹以后，这台机器什么都肯织——织什么由你钉。工坊严令：慎用。"
msgstr "Once it takes a Scorched Pattern, this machine will weave anything you pin. Workshop order: use with care."

